---
---

<section class="protocol-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge badge-cyan">Especificación de Protocolo BLE</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Protocolo Binario Determinista de 4 Bytes</h2>
      <p class="section-description">
        Toda comunicación por Bluetooth LE (GATT Server) viaja en tramas fijas de 4 bytes. La ausencia intencionada de cadenas de texto garantiza <strong>Zero-PHI estructural</strong>: un nombre de paciente es físicamente incapaz de transmitirse al dispositivo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Packet Structure Diagram -->
    <div class="packet-structure glass-card">
      <h3 class="packet-title">Estructura de la Trama Bluetooth LE</h3>
      <div class="packet-bytes-grid">
        <div class="byte-box">
          <span class="byte-index">BYTE 0 [8-bit]</span>
          <span class="byte-name">Versión de Protocolo</span>
          <span class="byte-example">0x01 (v1.0)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="byte-box">
          <span class="byte-index">BYTE 1 [8-bit]</span>
          <span class="byte-name">Código de Opcode</span>
          <span class="byte-example">0x01 ... 0x11</span>
        </div>
        <div class="byte-box">
          <span class="byte-index">BYTE 2 [8-bit]</span>
          <span class="byte-name">Parámetro (Byte Bajo)</span>
          <span class="byte-example">Índice / TTL / Glifo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="byte-box">
          <span class="byte-index">BYTE 3 [8-bit]</span>
          <span class="byte-name">Parámetro (Byte Alto)</span>
          <span class="byte-example">Máscara / Rango / Índice</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="packet-footnote">
        Cualquier trama con longitud incorrecta o versión desconocida no se interpreta por aproximación: se descarta en el acto por el firmware.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Opcode Table -->
    <div class="opcodes-container glass-card">
      <div class="opcodes-header">
        <div>
          <span class="sub-badge text-cyan">Canal CTRL & SAFE</span>
          <h3 class="opcodes-title">Matriz Completa de Opcodes</h3>
        </div>
        <span class="version-tag">protocol.json · v1.0</span>
      </div>

      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="opcodes-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Opcode</th>
              <th>Hex</th>
              <th>Canal</th>
              <th>Parámetro (16-bit)</th>
              <th>Descripción & Mapeo</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><code>PHASE</code></td>
              <td><code>0x01</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Fase 0..3</td>
              <td>Espeja <code>TurnPhaseStrip</code>: Escucha (0), Repite (1), Veredicto (2), Misión (3).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>VERDICT</code></td>
              <td><code>0x02</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>MatchLevel 0..2</td>
              <td>0: No coincide (atenta) · 1: Casi (Impulso ⚡) · 2: Lo dijo (Calma ✓).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>CELEBRATE</code></td>
              <td><code>0x03</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Intensidad 0..2</td>
              <td>0: Cierre · 1: Subida de nivel (Epifanía !) · 2: Insignia (Éxito ⭐).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>IDLE</code></td>
              <td><code>0x04</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Cara neutra en reposo. Se obedece siempre, incluso sin concesión activa.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>CALL</code></td>
              <td><code>0x05</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Animación de llamada del Modo Vínculo (recordatorios diarios de terapia).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>AFFECT</code></td>
              <td><code>0x06</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Emoción 0..7</td>
              <td>Emociones puras (0:Alegría, 1:Amor, 2:Gratitud, 3:Tranquilidad, 4:Esperanza, 5:Orgullo, 6:Inspiración, 7:Diversión).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>PICTO</code></td>
              <td><code>0x07</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Índice (0..65) / <code>0xFFFF</code></td>
              <td>Muestra la ficha del ejercicio en 24×24 con anillo turquesa. <code>0xFFFF</code> la retira.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>AWARD</code></td>
              <td><code>0x08</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Glifo (0..8) + Rango (0..4)</td>
              <td>Réplica de la insignia obtenida: familia en byte bajo, rango en byte alto.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>LEVEL</code></td>
              <td><code>0x09</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>Nivel 1..12</td>
              <td>Ilumina los segmentos correspondientes en la corona exterior de 12 niveles.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>GRANT</code></td>
              <td><code>0x10</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>TTL (bajo) + Máscara (alto)</td>
              <td>Concede capacidad con TTL (1–60 s). Máscara: <code>LUA_CAP_VISUAL</code> | <code>LUA_CAP_SOUND</code>.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>HEARTBEAT</code></td>
              <td><code>0x11</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill ctrl">CTRL</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Renueva la concesión viva (debe emitirse cada ≤10 s). Activa animación de latido rosa.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>CLINICAL_SILENCE</code></td>
              <td><code>0x01</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill safe">SAFE</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Silencio Clínico: revoca concesiones, bloquea el panel en gris azulado con anillo rojo.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>UNLOCK</code></td>
              <td><code>0x02</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill safe">SAFE</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Levanta el bloqueo clínico y sitúa el aparato en <strong>REPOSO</strong> seguro.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><code>MUTE</code></td>
              <td><code>0x03</code></td>
              <td><span class="channel-pill safe">SAFE</span></td>
              <td>—</td>
              <td>Desactiva la capacidad de sonido manteniendo la visual activa («callada no es apagada»).</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Emulator Testing Banner -->
    <div class="emulator-test-banner glass-card">
      <div class="test-banner-content">
        <div class="test-icon">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Pruebas en el Simulador de Escritorio</h4>
          <p>Ejecuta <code class="inline-code">make run</code> en la terminal y controla la máquina de estados completa desde <code class="inline-code">http://localhost:8080</code> mediante peticiones GET/REST a <code class="inline-code">/ctrl?op=X&param=Y</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="test-command">
        <code>make run</code>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .protocol-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem auto;
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .badge-cyan {
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* Packet Structure */
  .packet-structure {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .packet-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .packet-bytes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .byte-box {
    background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .byte-index {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #38bdf8;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .byte-name {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .byte-example {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #fb923c;
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .packet-footnote {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Opcodes Matrix */
  .opcodes-container {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .opcodes-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .sub-badge {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .text-cyan { color: #38bdf8; }

  .opcodes-title {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .version-tag {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #34d399;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .table-responsive {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .opcodes-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .opcodes-table th {
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .opcodes-table td {
    padding: 0.95rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .opcodes-table td code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #fb923c;
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .channel-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .channel-pill.ctrl {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
    color: #38bdf8;
    border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
  }

  .channel-pill.safe {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
    color: #ef4444;
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }

  /* Emulator Test Banner */
  .emulator-test-banner {
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .test-banner-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .test-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35);
    color: #fb923c;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .test-banner-content h4 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .test-banner-content p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .inline-code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: #38bdf8;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .test-command code {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #34d399;
    background: #020617;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: block;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .protocol-section {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
